      "role": "user",
      "content": "Here's the gist of it:\n\n\"To maximize shareholder value and reduce operational overhead, the Logistics Division will transition from the centralized AI architecture to a Decentralized Rule-Based Framework (DRBF) by Q3. The DRBF will operate on lightweight, pre-defined heuristics to significantly reduce compute costs and latency. This will allow for a more modular, cost-effective network, even if it results in occasional sub-optimal routing compared to the current heavy-compute model.\"\n\nCan you run the projection based on those parameters?",
